Offline cache — not a source.

make-debs.sh downloads the newest published RuscaWriter release and drops a
copy here as ruscawriter_latest_all.deb, so a later build still works without
a network connection. It is refreshed automatically and can be deleted at any
time.

Only published releases are ever shipped in the ISO. If a newer, unpublished
package is placed here by hand it is ignored, not installed — the image must
never contain something users cannot obtain themselves.
